          "description": "存储值的大小。\n\n取值范围: 1-[10240-1024*1024*1024]"
        },
        "storage_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "ULTRAHIGH",
          "description": "存储类型:\n- ULTRAHIGH:超高IO\n- COMMON:普通IO"
